# RE:GENESIS frontend aesthetic

Reference: https://researchh-five.vercel.app/ (PolicyLens)

## Palette
- Frame: `#F6F5F0` on outer `#111111`
- Ink: `#111111` · muted: `#6D6D6D` · line: `#D8D6CF`
- Highlight: `#C8F06A` on italic `<em>` keywords
- Dark product cards: `#111` / `#141414` with lime status chips

## Type
- **Inter** 400/500/600 — medium weight headlines, tight tracking (~-0.035em)
- Eyebrows: 11px, 600, uppercase, wide letter-spacing
- Body: muted gray, comfortable line-height ~1.55

## UI
- Pill CTAs (`border-radius: 999px`): solid black primary, white + gray border secondary
- Lime square bullets on hero feature list
- Large rounded dark cards (~22px) for product demos
- Section indexes like `01 / Pipeline`
- Sparse white panels with hairline borders — no glass, no neon glow, no emoji
